msgid "SSL Verify"
msgstr "Verifica SSL"

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1119
msgid "Whether to verify SSL for the request."
msgstr "Se verificare SSL per la richiesta."

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1126
msgid "Use URLs for File Fields"
msgstr "Usa URL per i campi file"

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1128
msgid ""
"If checked, file and signature fields will be converted to URLs instead of "
"file objects. Multiple files are comma separated."
msgstr ""
"Se selezionato, i campi file e firma verranno convertiti in URL anziché in "
"oggetti file. I file multipli sono separati da virgole."

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1135
msgid "Ignore Empty Values"
msgstr "Ignora valori vuoti"

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1137
msgid ""
"If checked, keys with an empty value will not be included in the request."
msgstr ""
"Se selezionato, le chiavi con un valore vuoto non verranno incluse nella "
"richiesta."

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1144
msgid "Convert Arrays to Delimited Text"
msgstr "Converti array in testo delimitato"

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1146
msgid ""
"If checked, fields that have multiple values (e.g. Checkboxes) will be "
"converted to comma separated values."
msgstr ""
"Se selezionato, i campi che hanno più valori (ad es. Caselle di controllo) "
"verranno convertiti in valori separati da virgole."

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1153
msgid "Array Delimiter"
msgstr "Delimitatore array"

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1155
msgid "Enter a delimiter to use if an array is converted to delimited text."
msgstr ""
"Inserisci un delimitatore da usare se un array viene convertito in testo "
"delimitato."

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1174
msgid "Deduplicate Arrays"
msgstr "Deduplica array"

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1176
msgid "If checked, multiple mappings to the same key will be deduplicated."
msgstr ""
"Se selezionato, più mappature sulla stessa chiave verranno deduplicate."

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1183
msgid "Cookie Passthrough"
msgstr "Pass-through cookie"

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1185
